DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       lvextend extends the size of an LV. This  requires  allocating  logical
       extents  from  the  VG's free physical extents. If the extension adds a
       new LV segment, the new segment will use the existing segment  type  of
       the LV.

       Extending a copy-on-write snapshot LV adds space for COW blocks.

       Use  llvvccoonnvveerrtt(8) to change the number of data images in a RAID or mir-
       rored LV.

       In the usage section below, ----ssiizzee _S_i_z_e can be replaced with  ----eexxtteennttss
       _N_u_m_b_e_r.  See both descriptions the options section.

