              rroorr|rraaiidd|tthhiinn|ccaacchhee|vvddoo|tthhiinn--ppooooll|ccaacchhee--ppooooll|vvddoo--ppooooll
              The LV type, also known as "segment type" or "segtype".  See us-
              age descriptions for the specific ways to use these types.  For
