              rroorr, ssttrriippeedd, lliinneeaarr) see llvvmmrraaiidd(7).  For thin provisioning
              (tthhiinn, tthhiinn--ppooooll) see llvvmmtthhiinn(7).  For performance caching
              (ccaacchhee, ccaacchhee--ppooooll) see llvvmmccaacchhee(7).  For copy-on-write snap-
              shots (ssnnaappsshhoott) see usage definitions.  For VDO (vvddoo) see
              llvvmmvvddoo(7).  Several commands omit an explicit type option be-
              cause the type is inferred from other options or shortcuts (e.g.
              --stripes, --mirrors, --snapshot, --virtualsize, --thin,
